cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite both the software and the manuscript it accompanies."
title: "ELASTIBD spleen stiffness: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Python code reproducing the tables, figures and statistical models of the
  ELASTIBD analysis of thiopurine exposure and spleen stiffness in
  inflammatory bowel disease, including cumulative thiopurine dose in
  azathioprine equivalents, a Firth penalised logistic regression
  implementation with profile penalised-likelihood inference, and a
  reproduction check against the published numbers.
type: software
license: MIT
