date-released: 2026-10-14
repository-code: "https://github.com/bfagargun/ELASTIBD-spleen-stiffness"
keywords:
  - spleen stiffness
  - transient elastography
  - thiopurines
  - azathioprine
  - porto-sinusoidal vascular disease
  - inflammatory bowel disease
